<title>USA: Tecumseh Products Co raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Tecumseh Products Co raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>TECUMSEH, Mich. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.30		     $0.26</p>
<p> Pay	     December 20</p>
<p> Record	   December 6</p>
<p>NOTE: Company also declared special year-end cash dividend of $0.60 a share, payable on December 20 to shareholders of record as of December 6.</p>
